      "text": "Revenue grew from {{m:revenue:FY-2}} in {{p:FY-2}} to {{m:revenue:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and {{m:revenue:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}, with EBITDA of {{m:ebitda:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and {{m:ebitda:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}."
      ,
      "citations": []
