    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "P&G maintains bank credit facilities in the form of an $8.0 billion facility split between a $3.2 billion five-year facility and a $4.8 billion 364-day facility, and these facilities are currently undrawn with management anticipating they will remain undrawn.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "PG-000008042426000103-0117",
          "quote": "The current facility is an $8.0 billion facility split between a $3.2 billion five-year facility and a $4.8 billion 364-day facility"
